//! Low-level stdout printing helpers shared by every module.
//!
//! All module output goes through the helpers in this file so that output
//! behaves uniformly: lines are terminated with "\r\n", every print is
//! flushed immediately, and a closed output stream results in a panic.
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
//!
